     <p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">为切实做好运动会期间的安全管理工作，积极应对可能发生的各类突发事件，确保运动会的正常开展</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">特制定校运动会期间的安全安全应急预案。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">一、安全应急组织机构：</span></strong></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">为切实加强运动会期间安全工作的组织领导，确保应急工作的顺利进行，职责明确，责任到人，学校成立运动会期间安全应急工作领导小组。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">一）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">领导小组</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">：</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">组长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">孙洪亮、蒋明</span>　　<span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">副组长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">何隽豪、陈炳炉</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">主要</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">成员：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">刘明玉、冯王亮、孟德超、钟慧军、施笑程、王月琴、陈昌勇、王宁、范国娟、魏杲、体育教师、项目主裁判</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">二）</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">主要职责：</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 16px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%">　<span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.指导</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">有关老师到达规定岗位，采取相应的应对措施。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">安排老师开展相关的抢险排危或实施求救工作。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">根据需要对师生进行疏散，并根据事件性质，及时报请上级有关部门。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 16px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%">　<span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">4.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">根据需要对现场采取控制措施。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">根据天气情况决定比赛是否正常进行。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">二</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">、具体实施方案</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">一</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）运动会前做好以下工作：</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">运动会组织委员会人员、裁判员、所有工作人员、各班班主任布置运动会事宜，提出安全方面的要求。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">班主任向学生讲明具体的安全措施及学校安全方案，把安全教育放在首位。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">（</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">二</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">）运动会期间做好以下工作：</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">运动会组织委员会人员、裁判员、所有工作人员责任到位、责任到人，各司其责，杜绝事故的发生，以确保运动会正常进行。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 16px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%">　<span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">裁判员应负责好本裁判区域内运动员的安全，确保比赛的正常进行。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">班主任跟班，负责运动员参加比赛，组织</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">班级</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">学生有秩序观看比赛，确保班中运动员与其他学生的安全。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 16px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%">　<span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">4.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">运动会期间，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">如遇</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">学生伤病及时送往医务点救治，发生意外事故及时报告安全应急领导小组，确保全班学生安全守纪。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">5.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">运动会期间管理人员、裁判员、后勤保障人员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">发现</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">事故，根据现场</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">情况</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">开展救护工作，将事故的危害降低到最低程度。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">三</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">、应急处理</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">人员安排</span></strong></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">安全疏散指挥：何隽豪、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">陈炳炉、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">王宁</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">检录区域：何伟丹</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">径赛场区域：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">何隽豪</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">田赛场地区域：孟德超</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">铅球区域：翁鹏飞</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">跳远区域</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">胡勇</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">立定三级跳远区域：金华元</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">跳高区域：徐建光</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">实心球区域：张豪</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">垒球区域：季潮丞</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">集体项目区域：沈祥土</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">食品安全：</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">陈昌勇</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">现场各班</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">班主任</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">负责做好本班学生的自我安全保护工作。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">突如其来的伤害事故（件）由</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">何隽豪、陈炳炉、王宁、范国娟</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">负责指挥调集抢险人员抢险。同时，事发现场第一责任应按下列规定处置：</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">1.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">发现学生在运动场内受伤或身体不适，应当立即</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">向班主任和裁判员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">报告，并送</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">医疗点</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">。如校医认为有必要送医院救治的，应迅速通知家长，并由家长陪同就医，若家长不能陪同的，必须由校医或</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">班主任</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">陪同到医院。</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">2.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">运动场内发现</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">争议冲突，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">现场老师或第一位发现突发事件的当事人为应急处理第一责任人，应迅速采取措施进行制止并报告</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">学校德育处、安全处人员和学校</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">领导。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">3.</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">应急领导小组组长可根据</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">天气及其他情况</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">决定比赛是继续进行还是暂停，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">如暂停</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">各将运动员带回班级待命，随时准备继续进行比赛。</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">                                                                               大会组委会 <span style="font-family:宋体">安全处</span>  </span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px;text-indent: 32px;padding: 0;line-height: 150%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px">                         <span style="font-family:宋体">10月19日</span></span></p><p>
</p>
    
